  /// must use. For example, the Amazon S3 and Web Crawler connectors require
  /// the following JSON schemas: Amazon S3 JSON schema Web Crawler JSON
  /// schema You can find configuration templates for your specific data
  /// source using the following steps: Navigate to the Supported connectors
  /// page in the Amazon Q Business User Guide, and select the data source of
  /// your choice. Then, from your specific data source connector page, select
  /// Using the API . You will find the JSON schema for your data source,
  /// including parameter descriptions, in this section.
