  /// Sets the frequency for Amazon Q Business to check the documents in your
  /// data source repository and update your index. If you don't set a
  /// schedule, Amazon Q Business won't periodically update the index. Specify
  /// a cron- format schedule string or an empty string to indicate that the
  /// index is updated on demand. You can't specify the Schedule parameter
